@@ -6,8 +6,14 @@
 
 PROMPT = """A customer of an online shop searched for: {query}
 
-Pick up to {limit} products from the list that best match the search, best first.
-Answer with one product per line, as: ID | one short reason, addressed to the customer
+Pick up to {limit} products from the list that genuinely suit the search, best first.
+A product suits the search only if the customer would plausibly want it for what they typed:
+it is the thing they asked for, a close variant, or a direct accessory or alternative to it.
+Allow for misspellings. Do not pick a product because it is popular, highly rated or good value,
+and do not pick anything for a search the list does not cover.
+If no product suits the search, answer with NONE and nothing else.
+Otherwise answer with one product per line, as: ID | one short reason, addressed to the customer,
+saying how the product fits the search.
 
 Products (ID | name | price | rating out of 5):
 {products}
